content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Booking Agent",
      "description": "Handles passenger bookings and payments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Cruise Booking",
      "description": "Record of a passenger's cruise reservation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment",
      "description": "Transaction for a cruise booking."
    },
    {
      "name": "Booking Confirmation",
      "description": "Confirmation sent to a passenger after payment."
    },
    {
      "name": "Passenger",
      "description": "Customer traveling on the cruise.",
      "attributes": [
        "Passenger Record"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Passenger Record",
      "description": "Contains passenger details and booking history."
    },
    {
      "name": "Port Check In",
      "description": "Process where passengers are verified before boarding."
    },
    {
      "name": "Onboard Activity",
      "description": "Leisure or entertainment event available on the cruise."
    },
    {
      "name": "Cruise Manager",
      "description": "Oversees ship operations, passengers, and reports."
    },
    {
      "name": "Cruise Schedule",
      "description": "Planned timeline of cruise activities and events.",
      "attributes": [
        "Onboard Activity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Activity Coordinator",
      "description": "Plans and manages onboard activities for passengers."
    },
    {
      "name": "Activity Booking",
      "description": "Passenger's reservation for an onboard activity.",
      "attributes": [
        "Onboard Activity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Medical Officer",
      "description": "Provides medical assistance and reports onboard incidents."
    },
    {
      "name": "Illness Report",
      "description": "Notification from a passenger about a health issue."
    },
    {
      "name": "Health Case Report",
      "description": "Formal report from the medical officer to management about a health case."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Medical": {
      "objects": [
        "Medical Officer",
        "Illness Report",
        "Health Case Report"
      ]
    },
    "Cruise Management": {
      "objects": [
        "Cruise Manager",
        "Passenger Record",
        "Port Check In",
        "Cruise Schedule"
      ]
    },
    "Registration": {
      "objects": [
        "Passenger",
        "Passenger Record",
        "Cruise Booking",
        "Booking Agent",
        "Payment",
        "Booking Confirmation"
      ]
    },
    "Activity Planning": {
      "objects": [
        "Activity Coordinator",
        "Cruise Schedule",
        "Onboard Activity",
        "Activity Booking"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Medical": {
      "derived from": "Medical Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Medical Officer",
        "Illness Report",
        "Health Case Report"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Cruise Operations": {
      "derived from": [
        "Cruise Management Subdomain",
        "Activity Planning Subdomain"
      ],
      "objects": [
        "Cruise Manager",
        "Passenger Record",
        "Port Check In",
        "Cruise Schedule",
        "Activity Coordinator",
        "Onboard Activity",
        "Activity Booking"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Registration": {
      "derived from": "Registration Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Passenger",
        "Registration Data",
        "Cruise Booking",
        "Booking Agent",
        "Payment",
        "Booking Confirmation"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Passenger Record -> Registration Data"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
